  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Programme 2016 -  2020 / TP 1 - Statebuilding and Good governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective, legitimate and resilient local government institutions serving Palestinians in WBG, and ensuring a continued Palestinian presence in Area C of the West Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the institutional capacity of municipalities in West Bank and Gaza for more accountable and sustainable service delivery.  The participants of the project are all 144 municipalities in the West Bank and Gaza. The beneficiaries are the population in all the municipalities, estimated at approx. 3, 611,649  representing 75% of the total population of West Bank and Gaza</narrative>
  </description>
